---
// spec: S23 /jobs/nts (F18-AC3, A-12 reserved slug). Matn aam rehnumai hai (owner ka faisla 13b-3a); owner tasdeeq kare.
import OrgJobsPage from '../../components/OrgJobsPage.astro';

export const prerender = false;

const faq = [
  { q: 'Kya NTS khud naukri deta hai?', a: 'Nahin. NTS testing ka idara hai. Woh mukhtalif mahkamon ki bharti ke test leta hai; naukri woh mahkama deta hai.' },
  { q: 'Kya GVS Academy NTS ka hissa hai?', a: 'Nahin. GVS niji academy hai. Hum sirf form bharne aur tayyari mein madad karte hain.' },
  { q: 'Roll number slip kahan milti hai?', a: 'Aam taur par NTS ki official website se, CNIC number daal kar. Test ki tareekh aur jagah usi par hoti hai.' },
  { q: 'Test ki fee kahan jama hoti hai?', a: 'Ishtihar mein likhe tareeqe se, aksar bank challan ya online. Yeh hamari service fee se alag hai.' },
];
---
<OrgJobsPage path="/jobs/nts" org="NTS" fullName="National Testing Service" officialUrl="https://www.nts.org.pk" faq={faq}>
  <section>
    <h2>NTS kya hai?</h2>
    <p>
      NTS, yani National Testing Service, ek testing ka idara hai. Bohat se sarkari aur niji mahkame apni bharti ka test NTS se karwate hain. Is liye
      NTS ka ishtihar asal mein kisi mahkame ki job ka hota hai, aur NTS us ka test leta hai. Ishtihar mein mahkame ka naam, post, taleem, umar aur
      akhri tareekh likhi hoti hai.
    </p>
    <p>
      NTS ke kuch tests bharti ke ilawa bhi hote hain, jaise dakhle ya scholarship ke. Is page par sirf jobs ke tests ki baat hai.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>NTS ka form kaise bharein</h2>
    <p>
      NTS ki official website par us test ka form kholen. Apni maloomat aur taleem likhein, tasveer lagayen, aur test ki fee ishtihar mein likhe
      tareeqe se jama karein. Fee jama hone ke baad form mukammal hota hai. Test se pehle roll number slip website se nikal lein aur us par likhi
      tareekh, waqt aur jagah dekh lein.
    </p>
    <p>
      Test ke din CNIC aur roll number slip sath le jayen. Kai tests mein mobile phone le jane ki ijazat nahin hoti, is liye hidayat pehle parh lein.
    </p>
    <p>
      Test ke baad nateeja bhi aam taur par NTS ki website par CNIC number se dekha jata hai. Aage ka faisla, jaise interview ya merit list, us
      mahkame ki taraf se hota hai jis ki post thi.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Test ka aam pattern</h2>
    <p>
      NTS ke job tests aksar MCQs par hote hain. Sawal aam taur par verbal (English), quantitative (hisab), analytical, general knowledge aur us post
      ke mazmoon se aate hain. Har test ke ishtihar mein us ke hisse aur marks likhe hote hain; tayyari usi ke mutabiq karein.
    </p>
    <p>
      Muft tayyari ke liye <a href="/daily-test">rozana test</a>, <a href="/mcqs">mazmoon-war MCQs</a> aur <a href="/mock-tests">mock tests</a> dein.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Hum kaise madad karte hain</h2>
    <p>
      Job ke page par "Hum apply kar dein" dabayen. Hum form bhar kar fee ka challan aur form ki copy WhatsApp par bhejte hain. Hamari fee alag hai aur
      test ki fee alag, official tareeqe se. Tafseel <a href="/apply-service">apply service</a> par.
    </p>
  </section>
</OrgJobsPage>
